  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for ICT integration in education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to enhance the institutional capacity of Ghana&apos;s Centre for National Distance Learning and Open Schooling (CENDLOS) to enable them support teachers and learners capacity building in digital learning. Key activities include supporting CENDLOS to participate in the 2024 Digital Learning Week at UNESCO HQ. Engagements with  ED/PLS/ICT and ED/PLS/TED colleagues and the government officials to activate sustainability plans and to also engage other potential donors for a possible scale up of the Emergency Remote Teaching (ERT) model developed by UNESCO and rolled out in Ghana.</narrative>
  </description>
